       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I need you to check the dose first.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg daily is 5 times the usual adult maximum of 200 mg/day.** Usual dosing:\n- Starting dose: 25\u201350 mg once daily\n- Typical range: 50\u2013200 mg/day\n- Maximum: 200 mg/day\n\nA dose this high could cause serotonin syndrome, QTc prolongation and seizures. Since a single extra zero would explain it, the intended dose may have been **100 mg** once daily.\n\nPlease tell me which dose you want:\n1. **Sertraline 100 mg by mouth, once daily**, or\n2. Another dose within 25\u2013200 mg/day.\n\nIf you really do mean 1000 mg, the reason needs to be documented and checked by pharmacy before I'll enter it."
